{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0044_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5a7c541fa128b61ae79043b5e6ebdef8f4a05d8136f8ddf71cdc0dcd64606e32", "ja": "（正月早々の、千早の新春ライブも大詰めだ。\n会場は最高潮に盛り上がっている……！）", "zh": "（千早在新年举办的新春演唱会即将圆满结束。\n会场的气氛也来到最高点……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0044_1001_002chi", "source_sha256": "5605c33cde4e598565ecd33c4488d96ad17e6a9152e9186f1fba3d8124b23932", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ……、{$P$}。\nたしか次の曲で、今日のライブは……。", "zh": "呼、呼……{$P$}。\n我记得还剩下一首歌，今天的演唱会就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0044_1002_p", "source_sha256": "42f07a707a6a46d9f6cd3ebbf1e7009c8f0684e9544288d00e78fecc899d2a1d", "ja": "ああ、次で終わりだよ。とりあえず汗をふこうか。\nそのままだと、外の風で身体が冷えるからな。", "zh": "是啊，下一首唱完就结束了。先擦擦汗吧。\n不然在外面吹风，身体会着凉的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0044_1003_002chi", "source_sha256": "697cd63d53c48469c8e96b121a98133a7ffe27783cb0d71a92eeb1468729242f", "ja": "あ……、ありがとうございます。\nあの、それよりも……。", "zh": "啊……谢谢你。\n不好意思，其实我想问的是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0044_1004_002chi", "source_sha256": "73f1f7e56f274295dc65954c8b9c743cfb6707ba04b3357cea6ecd65d828a547", "ja": "私は、ちゃんと……届けられているでしょうか。", "zh": "不知道我有没有……好好地传达出去呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0044_1005_p", "source_sha256": "25e2fc34214682713217323617126b2036558655d235cb7c8d38976d3998a60d", "ja": "ん？　お客さんの熱気は、ここまで伝わってくる。\nちゃんと心に届いてるってことじゃないか？", "zh": "嗯？连这里都能感受到观众们的热情。\n这就表示你的心意有确实传达出去了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0044_1006_002chi", "source_sha256": "0adeea77fbee501cce494ee63f5c51297eda6989da060ffae4112e0cec6b0309", "ja": "そう……かもしれません。ですが今日は、\n神社の境内をお借りしての新春ライブ……。", "zh": "我的心意……或许传达出去了。但今天的新春演唱会，\n是借用神社的场地举办的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0044_1007_002chi", "source_sha256": "29508cce1b61bfbe6380452e0aba1b1446b4ac48f297723b25187462e7698502", "ja": "新年を迎えて、お参りに来た方たちの願いを、\nきちんと……神様に届けなくては、と。", "zh": "有很多人为了迎接新的一年，特地来神社参拜，\n我认为也要帮他们将愿望……确实地传达给神明才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0044_1008_p", "source_sha256": "0d0a4638402903ce1116f4893eae2080cc00ea581770b7410219ebf453597669", "ja": "なるほど、神様か……。となると、あんまり無責任な\nことを言うとバチがあたりそうだけど。", "zh": "原来如此，想传达给神明吗……\n那我要是随便乱讲话，可能会遭天谴吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0044_1009_p", "source_sha256": "bafa256428bae408f83749137861e6cc9a8f7222f1c5ce752b25462ba9cd3d1e", "ja": "でも、きっと神様も聞いてくれてると思う。\n案外もう、客席に混じってたりするかもしれないぞ？", "zh": "不过，我觉得神明一定也听到你的歌声了。\n说不定其实祂们就混在观众席中呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0044_1010_002chi", "source_sha256": "3469cf6419c087ae1c8ab8ade77b1e4822a5001261817347212d264f3d81c5f4", "ja": "神様が……、客席に？", "zh": "神明……在观众席？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0044_1011_p", "source_sha256": "1973b43e126d6b494329c35085d363240ca5fd6cde7231b6976f6ab707c57fa0", "ja": "お正月だし、せっかくの舞台だし。\n神様もみんなと一緒に盛り上がりたいんじゃないかな。", "zh": "毕竟现在是新年嘛，又难得有舞台表演。\n或许神明也想和大家一起热闹一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0044_1012_002chi", "source_sha256": "9fa3d13364d52e9f0e3c817f42980a8968117573eafae363e12234a25f3e95d2", "ja": "……。ふふっ、そうかもしれませんね！", "zh": "……呵呵，或许真的是这样呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0044_1013_002chi", "source_sha256": "cc08d70be86028d11bd848c481ca7c797a69d47702380d740e4028418183dca4", "ja": "わかりました。では、神様も混じっていると信じて……\n今は目の前のみなさんのために、最後まで。", "zh": "好吧，那我就相信神明也在观众席中……\n现在要为了眼前的所有观众，坚持到最后。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0044_1014_p", "source_sha256": "7eea5419cda556855ffcfeb33db19773a663b66207f77ebbff110827460b3a80", "ja": "ああ、これだけ盛り上がってるんだから、\n神様も力を貸してくれるかもしれないぞ。", "zh": "是啊，现场反应这么热烈，\n说不定神明也有帮忙喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0044_1015_002chi", "source_sha256": "1e36ab68eda683e0d40da5522bb0ada1ff0e15c182f6ec7084d1f35c82f91098", "ja": "神様も……。\nそれはまだ、難しいかもしれません。", "zh": "神明也有帮忙……\n这大概不太可能吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0044_1016_p", "source_sha256": "782b878c3096bfdf27705121f67503fa94eeed71930e618f5bb18ba6b7ba107f", "ja": "えっ。どうしてまた？", "zh": "咦？你怎么这样说呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0044_1017_002chi", "source_sha256": "c32f7a59c5a23f43a775f44ff4fd2c80998b013fbdcca0a8612ca833f9c5f62c", "ja": "神様なら、よくご存じだと思いますから。\n私に力を貸してくれる人は……もう、隣にいるって。", "zh": "我觉得神明一定看得很清楚。\n真正帮助我的人……早就在我身边了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0044_1018_p", "source_sha256": "d8d317677ae1ded44942e6ee50a71acaf3a5fff85483aaa22c77123894ac8c34", "ja": "千早……。", "zh": "千早……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0044_1019_002chi", "source_sha256": "c122528663d3b89c827bfa66d19decbcb78ade746dfac5b202ecbebdafa7ea47", "ja": "あ、あの、それに事務所にも劇場にも……。\nとにかく、たくさん。", "zh": "而、而且，还有事务所和剧场的伙伴……\n总之，有很多人在帮助我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0044_1020_p", "source_sha256": "d1d8996a088116bbde2689c5837c56c4618c34013e2d75978444852c5b57d573", "ja": "……そうだったな。それじゃ、最後まで見てもらおう。\nたくさんの人が支えてくれる、千早のステージを！", "zh": "……你说得对，那就坚持到最后吧。\n千早背后有这么多人支持着，让我看看你的精彩表演吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0044_1021_002chi", "source_sha256": "33716ded6aca2254967c4d9a09f0fcf6effcb68abca50dbfc8e0146e55f473bc", "ja": "はい。あらためて、旧年中の感謝と、\n新年への希望をこめて。行ってきます！", "zh": "好的，我会带着对去年的感谢\n以及对新年的期许来唱的。我上场了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0044_1022_p", "source_sha256": "21919b86735946f8129a7f9a25a33e7eec5e22165815fa7bf614a3bc94e30b65", "ja": "（新年最初のフィナーレを、千早は笑顔で迎えられた。\nどうやら今年も、いい1年になりそうだな！）", "zh": "（千早以笑容迎接新年首次表演的终曲。\n看来今年也会是顺遂的一年！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
